{"abstract":[{"text":"T21.4 \/ D5 — who created this registration: ","type":"text"},{"code":"admin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"dcr","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"cimd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Echoed because an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"operator auditing a tenant needs to answer “which of these did we create?” from this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"endpoint rather than from the database, and because three behaviours hang off it: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"non-","type":"text"},{"code":"admin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" client may never carry the FAPI profile, is always consent-gated, and is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only kind the unused-client sweeper touches. Read-only. There is no corresponding member","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the update DTO: a registration’s provenance is a fact about how it came to exist, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a field that could be edited to ","type":"text"},{"code":"admin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" would be a field that launders one.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/oauth2clientresponse\/managedby"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"managedBy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9ManagedByO","text":"ManagedBy","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"managedBy","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK20OAuth2ClientResponseV9managedByAA07ManagedG0Ovp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"managedBy"},{